      "adaptation": {
        "semantic": "Some languages use the same word for this conjunction and for the determiner or pronoun **either**; in English, the conjunction always pairs with **or**, while the other uses do not.",
        "grammar": "**Either ... or** joins two grammatically parallel elements: two nouns, two verbs, or two clauses, never a noun and a clause.",
